# Convex — Offtake OS monorepo

- Backend source: `packages/backend/convex/` (`convex.json` points here)
- Before editing Convex code, read `packages/backend/convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md`
- Dev: `bun run convex:dev` or `bunx convex dev` — never `convex deploy` during development
- Package manager: Bun (`bun install`, `bun run …`)

## Functions

- Public `query` / `mutation` / `action`: validate `args` and `returns`
- Always `await` promises in Convex handlers
- Auth: `ctx.auth.getUserIdentity()` on functions that touch user data
- Prefer indexes (`.withIndex`) over `.filter()` on DB queries
- No `Date.now()` inside queries (pass time as arg or use scheduled jobs)
- Schedule only `internal.*` functions, never public `api.*`
- `"use node"` files: actions only, no queries/mutations
- Paginate unbounded lists; avoid `.collect()` on large tables
- Put business logic in plain TS helpers; keep function wrappers thin
- TypeScript strict; avoid `any`; use `Doc<"table">` / `Id<"table">`

## This project

- Auth: `@convex-dev/auth` + Google OAuth
- RAG: `@convex-dev/rag` in `lib/rag.ts`, namespace `"global"`
- Marketplace schema: `farmerProfiles`, `buyerProfiles`, `listings`, `orders`
- Shared constants: import `CROP_TYPES`, `COUNTIES` from `@repo/types`, do not duplicate
